<title>DENMARK: BADMINTON-DANISH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-DANISH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDELFART, Denmark 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in</p>
<p>the Danish Open badminton championships on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>3/4-Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) beat 1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-7 7-15 15-9</p>
<p>3/4-Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark) beat Peter Gade (Denmark)</p>
<p>5-15 15-6 17-14</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Marina Andrievskaya (Sweden) beat 5/8- Mette Pedersen (Denmark)</p>
<p>3-11 12-10 11-8</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao (China) beat 3/4-Christine Gandrup (Sweden) 11-1</p>
<p>11-3</p>
</text>
